WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.040
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.960
No D-Class gladiator games!

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.820
Dr. Bright is strictly prohibited from conducting
any gladiatorial arena combat between D-Class.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:17.150
He is especially not allowed to conduct these
games with SCP being used as weapons.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.670
Not even if it looks cool.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.400
Not even if it's funny.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.280
Not even if the D-Class would rather play
gladiator than be used in cross-testing with

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.880
SCP-682

